# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Wrangler reads this file and keeps it
# out of git; deployed environments set the same names as Worker secrets.
#
# HMAC keys for the signed session cookies. Any local values work; a production
# deployment without one refuses to sign that kind of user in (503) instead of
# falling back to a guessable default. Use a different value for each.
STUDENT_SESSION_SECRET="local-development-only-change-me"
TEACHER_SESSION_SECRET="local-development-only-teacher-change-me"
